Text 405 404
YOU HAVE ENTERED DEEPLY INTO THE INFESTED
STARPORT. BUT SOMETHING IS WRONG. THE
MONSTERS HAVE BROUGHT THEIR OWN REALITY
WITH THEM, AND THE STARPORT'S TECHNOLOGY
IS BEING SUBVERTED BY THEIR PRESENCE.

AHEAD, YOU SEE AN OUTPOST OF HELL, A
FORTIFIED ZONE. IF YOU CAN GET PAST IT,
YOU CAN PENETRATE INTO THE HAUNTED HEART
OF THE STARBASE AND FIND THE CONTROLLING
SWITCH WHICH HOLDS EARTH'S POPULATION
HOSTAGE.PLOWING THROUGH THE RESTRICTED AREA OF 
DOWNTOWN NEW ORLEANS REVEALED A 
REMOTE UAC FACTORY WITH SUSPICIOUS
ACTIVITY GOING ON. IT SEEMS THEY ARE 
DELIBERATELY USING NUCLEAR RADIATION
AND ALIEN TECHNOLOGY TO FARM MUTANTS.

SQUASHING THE CYBORG SPIDERBOT SHOULD 
PUT A DENT IN THE UAC'S MALICIOUS 
PLANS TO DOMINATE THE WORLD -- AS LONG
AS THERE ISN'T SOMETHING MORE 
DEADLY IN THE INDUSTRIAL PARK AHEAD.   

Text 617 617
YOU HAVE WON! YOUR VICTORY HAS ENABLED
HUMANKIND TO EVACUATE EARTH AND ESCAPE
THE NIGHTMARE.  NOW YOU ARE THE ONLY
HUMAN LEFT ON THE FACE OF THE PLANET.
CANNIBAL MUTATIONS, CARNIVOROUS ALIENS,
AND EVIL SPIRITS ARE YOUR ONLY NEIGHBORS.
YOU SIT BACK AND WAIT FOR DEATH, CONTENT
THAT YOU HAVE SAVED YOUR SPECIES.

BUT THEN, EARTH CONTROL BEAMS DOWN A
MESSAGE FROM SPACE: "SENSORS HAVE LOCATED
THE SOURCE OF THE ALIEN INVASION. IF YOU
GO THERE, YOU MAY BE ABLE TO BLOCK THEIR
ENTRY.  THE ALIEN BASE IS IN THE HEART OF
YOUR OWN HOME CITY, NOT FAR FROM THE
STARPORT." SLOWLY AND PAINFULLY YOU GET
UP AND RETURN TO THE FRAY.THE UAC HAS INFECTED THIS WORLD.
THE RENEGADE UAC MARINES ARE FIGHTING
ALONGSIDE THEIR MUTANT BRETHREN AND 
THEIR FORCES ARE GETTING GREATER.

THEY ARE DEFINITELY HIDING SOMETHING.
THERE IS SOMETHING THEY ARE TRYING TO
PROTECT. THIS IS AN ACT OF DESPERATION
AND PANIC. FUELED BY DECEIT AND SURVIVAL
INSTINCTS, YOU'VE MANIFESTED YOUR HUMAN
WEAPON CAPABILITIES AND THEY KNOW IT.

CHARGE YOUR PLASMA RIFLE, AND REV YOUR
CHAINSAW. THE UAC IS GOING TO BUILD 
MORE WALLS AND YOU'RE THE ONE WHO
IS GONNA BREAK THEM DOWN.                                                           
                                                                            
                                                                            
Text 164 164
CONGRATULATIONS, YOU'VE FOUND THE SECRET
LEVEL! LOOKS LIKE IT'S BEEN BUILT BY
HUMANS, RATHER THAN DEMONS. YOU WONDER
WHO THE INMATES OF THIS CORNER OF HELL
WILL BE.THE CYBER WORLD IS THE POWER SOURCE
OF SOMETHING FAR GREATER THAN WHAT YOU'VE  
SEEN SO FAR. YOUR JOURNEY IS COMING TO A 
CLOSE. THE BRAIN AWAITS...                 

Text 92 95
CONGRATULATIONS, YOU'VE FOUND THE
SUPER SECRET LEVEL!  YOU'D BETTER
BLAZE THROUGH THIS ONE!
YOU'VE DEFEATED THE UAC EMPIRE!
 
IF YOU HAD FUN, LOOK FOR THE MISSION PACK... 

COMING SOON!

